// Azure Activity control-plane operations, ingested via a subscription diagnostic
// setting (Method B). Method A - the Azure Policy path - failed twice here on
// managed-identity/session; for a single subscription the diagnostic setting is
// both simpler and architecturally appropriate.
AzureActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| project TimeGenerated, OperationNameValue, ActivityStatusValue, Caller, ResourceGroup
| order by TimeGenerated desc
